// Stage 0 candidate models. Adding a model is a config change only.
// Keys come from environment variables (apiKeyEnv), never this file.
//
// Before the first real run (M5), check:
//  - the Ollama tags below with `ollama list` (they are the expected names, not yet confirmed);
//  - that each server honours the thinkingOffBody fields. Ollama's OpenAI-compatible endpoint and llama.cpp
//    take different fields; the director's thinking is switched off so its 300-token cap isn't used up by reasoning.
{
  "repeats": 3,
  "models": [
    {
      "id": "raon-1-nano", "tier": "Minimum", "provider": "OpenAi",
